lishman to win in 25 years.\n\nPutellas plays for Barcelona and Spain. This is her third Ballon d'Or. She won the award before, in 2021 and 2022.\n\nMany other players won awards too. Lamine Yamal won the young player award for the third time. Bukayo Saka won the Socrates award for his charity.", "body_zh": "凯恩效力于拜仁慕尼黑和英格兰队。他在68场比赛中打进了77个球。他是25年来第一位获此奖项的英格兰人。\n\n普特利亚斯效力于巴塞罗那和西班牙队。这是她第三次获得金球奖。她曾在2021年和2022年获奖。\n\n许多其他球员也获得了奖项。拉明·亚马尔第三次获得最佳年轻球员奖。布卡约·萨卡因其慈善事业获得了苏格拉底奖。", "text": "Kane plays for Bayern Munich and England. He scored 77 goals in 68 games. He is the first Englishman to win in 25 years. Putellas plays for Barcelona and Spain. This is her third Ballon d'Or. She won the award before, in 2021 and 2022. Many other players won awards too. Lamine Yamal won the young player award for the third time. Bukayo Saka won the Socrates award for his charity.", "vocab": [{"word": "win", "pos": "verb", "zh": "赢得", "note": "过去式是 won", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "play", "pos": "verb", "zh": "效力；踢球", "note": "play for 表示效力于某队", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "goal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "进球", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "game", "pos": "noun", "zh": "比赛", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "award", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖项", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "first", "pos": "adj", "zh": "第一的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "third", "pos": "adj", "zh": "第三的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "charity", "pos": "noun", "zh": "慈善机构", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-27T00:42:00.481318", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Kane", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.55, "sm": 275, "em": 550, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "plays", "s": 0.55, "e": 0.875, "sm": 550, "em": 874, "cs": 5, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "for", "s": 0.875, "e": 1.0, "sm": 875, "em": 1000, "cs": 11, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "Bayern", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.4, "sm": 1000, "em": 1399, "cs": 15, "c